    "long_instructions": "# Style this page!\r\nHere is an opportunity to be creative and have some fun with styles.\r\n\r\n \r\n# Do this\r\n1) Link the stylesheet to the web page.\r\n2) Make the paragraph text a different size.\r\n3) Make the paragraph text a different color.\r\n   * It is your choice whether to use a named color or use an RGB color.\r\n",
